      },
      "title": "Bird",
      "subtitle": "An identity designed to take many forms.",
      "copy": "Built from fluid letterforms and bold geometric shapes, Bird's identity transforms a simple wordmark into a distinctive visual language.\n\nEach letter becomes a graphic element in its own right, creating a modular system that can be rearranged, repeated and scaled across digital, print, textiles and physical spaces.\n\nThe result is an expressive, contemporary identity that remains instantly recognisable, however it takes shape.",
